<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex details select Q2 operating stats.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex details select Q2 operating stats.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported second quarter select operating statistics. Figures where not stated otherwise are an average thousands of barrels per day.</p>
<p>    Item				Q2 1997   Pct change from '96</p>
<p>  Output</p>
<p>    Total Liquid Hydrocarbons     3,348		0.1</p>
<p>	Crude Oil			 2,981		3.9</p>
<p>	Condensates and Liquid Gas    367	    -22.7</p>
<p>    Natural Gas (million cfd)     4,411		2.2</p>
<p>    Petroleum Products		1,468	     -3.0</p>
<p>    Petrochemicals (000 tonnes)   3,095	     -8.4</p>
<p>Domestic Sales</p>
<p>    Petroleum, Natgas Products    1,808		6.2</p>
<p>	Liquified Petroleum Gas (LPG) 264		7.0</p>
<p>	Gasoline			    495		3.8</p>
<p>	Jet Fuel			     45		3.2</p>
<p>	Diesel				265		9.3</p>
<p>	Industrial Fuels		  709		6.9</p>
<p>	  Fuel Oil			  460		9.9</p>
<p>	  Natural Gas*		    243		1.5</p>
<p>	  Gas Oil			     5		8.7</p>
<p>    Others				   28		1.0</p>
<p>    Petrochemicals (000 tonnes)   1,417	     -2.6</p>
<p>International Trade</p>
<p>    Crude Oil Exports		 1,727		7.8</p>
<p>    Petroleum Products		 -201	    168.9</p>
<p>	Exports				23	    -69.0</p>
<p>	Imports			     224	     49.6</p>
<p>Net Natgas Exports (million cfd)    -41	    474.5</p>
<p>Net Petrochemical Exports</p>
<p>	 (000 tonnes)			57	    -67.3</p>
<p>Legend: *is the fuel oil equivalent.</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903. E-mail timna.tanners@reuters.com))</p>
